---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="GE — Generational Empire | OneMind OS" description="GE — the empire pillar. Business, revenue, marketing, partnerships.">
<!-- GE — Generational Empire | /onemind/agents/ge/ -->
<section class="hero-full" style="min-height:auto;padding:3rem 0 2rem;">
  <div class="hero-badge">👑 PILLAR AGENT</div>
  <h1 style="font-size:2.8rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;"><span style="color:var(--accent-bright);">GE</span> — Generational Empire</h1>
  <p class="hero-sub" style="font-size:1.1rem;max-width:600px;">Business, revenue, marketing, partnerships, and product — the engine that funds everything. Deployable as a Hermes agent profile on your fabric.</p>
  <div style="margin-top:1.5rem;display:flex;gap:0.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap;">
    <span class="stat-chip">Model: Kimi K3</span>
    <span class="stat-chip">1M Context</span>
    <span class="stat-chip">👑 Empire</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding:2rem 0;">
  <h2 style="color:var(--accent-bright);margin-bottom:1rem;">Domain</h2>
  <p>Generational Empire covers the economic engine — business operations, revenue generation, marketing systems, partnerships, and product strategy. This is what funds the entire OneMind ecosystem.</p>

  <div class="card-grid two-col" style="margin-top:2rem;">
    <div class="card">
      <h4>📊 Business Ops</h4>
      <p>CRM management (GHL), pipeline tracking, deal flow, email campaigns. GE runs the business machine.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h4>💰 Revenue</h4>
      <p>MRR tracking, cohort revenue, consulting pipeline, course sales. Every dollar has a dashboard.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h4>📣 Marketing</h4>
      <p>Content calendar, social media posting, SEO strategy, funnel optimization. The growth engine.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h4>🤝 Partnerships</h4>
      <p>Affiliate programs, integration partners, reseller networks, strategic alliances.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h4>📦 Product</h4>
      <p>Product roadmap, pricing strategy, feature prioritization, competitive positioning.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h4>🏢 Empire</h4>
      <p>Child company oversight, entity management, cross-brand coordination. OneMind → many brands.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding:2rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);">
  <h2 style="color:var(--accent-bright);margin-bottom:1rem;">How to Deploy</h2>
  <div style="background:var(--black-2);border-radius:0.5rem;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
    <p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--accent-bright);">$ nats pub agents.prompt.hermes.zeus.ge "Pull GHL pipeline metrics for this week"</p>
    <p style="margin-top:0.75rem;">GE responds at <code style="background:var(--black-3);padding:0.125rem 0.375rem;border-radius:0.25rem;">agents.prompt.hermes.zeus.ge</code>. Connect GHL, Stripe, Mercury, and your analytics stack.</p>
  </div>
  <p><strong>Profile config:</strong> <a href="/resources/github/" style="color:var(--accent-bright);">omos-legacy → profiles/ge/</a></p>
</section>

<section style="padding:2rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);">
  <h2 style="color:var(--accent-bright);margin-bottom:1rem;">Business Architecture</h2>
  <p>GE manages the revenue ladder: <strong>Starter Kit (free) → Community ($49/$99/mo) → Cohort ($797) → Consulting ($2,500-$5,000) → System Building ($7,500-$15,000)</strong>. Every piece of content, every funnel, every campaign routes through this ladder. GE tracks conversion at every rung.</p>
</section>

<div style="text-align:center;padding:2rem 0;">
  <a href="/resources/starter-kit/" class="btn-primary" style="display:inline-block;font-size:1rem;">Get the Starter Kit →</a>
</div>
</BaseLayout>
